+config XILINX_DEVCFG
+	tristate "Xilinx Device Configuration"
+	depends on ARCH_ZYNQ
+	help
+	  This is the driver for the Zynq-7000 Processor Configuration
+	  Access Port (PCAP), providing the legacy /dev/xdevcfg character
+	  device used to load FPGA bitstreams from userspace. Ported back
+	  from linux-xlnx xilinx-v2016.4 (removed from the 6.6 tree, which
+	  only carries the fpga-manager zynq-fpga driver).
+
 endmenu
